{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund research into PANS/PANDAS to provide better care and diagnosis",
        "additional_details": "These conditions can cause a rapid and devastating change in a child\u2019s cognitive, emotional, behavioural, and physical functioning. Despite the serious impact these symptoms can have, recognition, diagnosis, and access to specialist care remains inconsistent and there is a lack of research available. Families can face significant barriers to obtaining timely assessment, information, and appropriate treatment, leaving many feeling isolated and unsupported.",
        "background": "We urge the government to fund research into PANS/PANDAS which can help to support clear, evidence-informed clinical guidance to help healthcare professionals identify, assess, and manage these conditions appropriately. EVERY child deserves timely diagnosis, treatment, and the chance to thrive.",
        "closed_at": null,
